  "name": "vscode-lean",
  "description": "A Visual Studio Code extension that provides comprehensive IDE support for the Lean theorem prover by interfacing with the Lean server process via a custom JSON-based protocol. It implements essential formal verification features including real-time diagnostics, interactive proof goal visualization, and type-aware hover information. The extension also facilitates mathematical typesetting through a specialized Unicode input completion system and handles lean process lifecycle management.",
